{"id":"b63d92760bb408d3","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-transitive-set.md","title":"传递集合","display":"df-transitive-set — 传递集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-transitive-set","aliases":["18-df-transitive-set","18-df-012"],"display":"df-transitive-set — 传递集合","depends_on":["[[18-df-set]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"3.2, equation (3.2)","source_printed_pages":"20","source_pdf_pages":"30","source_correspondence":"set-instance-of-Tran","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-transitive-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-transitive-set</span><span>18-df-012</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transitive-set — 传递集合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea75cdbec811405b\" href=\"?note=ea75cdbec811405b\" title=\"18-df-set\">18-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2, equation (3.2)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"20"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"30"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"set-instance-of-Tran"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论为集合论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为集合变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans},\\operatorname{Tran}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans},\\operatorname{Tran}\\)</span> 是下式引入的同义谓词，集合语境见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea75cdbec811405b\" href=\"?note=ea75cdbec811405b\" title=\"18-df-set\">18-df-set</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(M)\\longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Tran}(M)\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Trans}(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Trans}(M)\\longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Tran}(M)\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Trans}(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的 Tran 同时适用于可定义类；本节点给出其集合实例，保留原笔记 Trans 接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"ea75cdbec811405b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"ea75cdbec811405b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"元理论为集合论，$M$ 为集合变量；$\\mathrm{Trans},\\operatorname{Tran}$ 是下式引入的同义谓词，集合语境见 [[18-df-set]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans},\\operatorname{Tran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}(M)\\longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Tran}(M)\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Trans}(M).","display":true}],"bytes":1037,"backlinks":[{"id":"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\mathrm{Trans}(A)$、$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$ 及序数类 $\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[./18-df-transitive-set]]、[[./18-df-ordinal]]。$L_\\alpha$ 为 [[./18-df-constructible-hierarchy]] 的构造层级，仅在序数 $\\alpha$ 上使用。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-transitive-set]]"},{"id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ 为下式引入的一元序数谓词；$a$ 为集合变量，集合语境见 [[18-df-set]]；$\\mathrm{Trans}$ 见 [[18-df-transitive-set]]。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-transitive-set]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-transitive-set]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-transitive-set|18-df-transitive-set]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-transitive-set|18-df-transitive-set]]"}],"outgoing":["ea75cdbec811405b"]}